From 54d84ed6030f588da01f71f046464860a56a5070 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:01:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(iw1 scorer): R/B/A verdicts carry the Verdict
 preconditions block (RULING iw1-R-pre)

Port of tools/iw2_score.py's _earn (iw2 shared prereg Amendment 2) to
tools/iw1_score.py: every R, B and A verdict now travels with what earned it,
so the verdict-preconditions gate accepts the iw1 R files. Same decision logic;
a PASS/FAIL whose precondition fails reads UNDEFINED, and a vacuous A is never
a PASS. Pinned by tests/test_iw1_score_earn.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YFsTogbFUHqkhjUeERc6a5
---
 tests/test_iw1_score_earn.py | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/iw1_score.py           | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
